message: "Please cite the repository and record the commit hash used for your verification run."
title: "k-space: verification of transverse-momentum TMD operators"
authors:
  - name: "uva-spin"
repository-code: "https://github.com/uva-spin/k-space"
license: MIT
abstract: "Native transverse-momentum CSS2 evolution with a declared N3LL evolution domain and strict-NLO hard/OPE boundaries. Includes distributional and contact algebra, sourced physical coefficients, non-Gaussian continuum and three-scale actual-PDF validation, quantified UV input bounds, and portable reproduction commands."
